+ *
+ * Stuck-RH remediation validated live 2026-07-18: a direct serial capture across
+ * an actual physical UC button press caught a valve's raw RH bit-exact flat for
+ * the whole pre-press window (with the valve pinned at 100% airflow), and both
+ * the airflow and the raw reading resumed moving immediately after the manual
+ * overrule -- confirming NodeSetOverrule (what this plugin issues automatically)
+ * has the same unsticking effect as the physical fix. The valve's paired UC's own
+ * independent RH sensor (when one exists) agreed with the valve's reading within
+ * ~0.2 points once unstuck, having disagreed by >30 points while stuck -- see
